OL,3,GNEWSARower delighted after
OL,4,Achampionships' 'declare as British to
OL,5,Acompete' U-turn
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Irish rowing champion who was told
OL,8,Fhe could only compete and receive a
OL,9,Franking in the British Rowing Indoor
OL,10,FChampionships (BRIC) if he declares
OL,11,Fhimself as British can now compete as
OL,12,Fan Irish entrant.
OL,14,FDaniel Collins, who is based in
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland, competed in last
OL,16,Fyear's event under the Irish flag, but
OL,17,Frules changed for the 2026 event as the
OL,18,FBRIC and the World Rowing Indoor
OL,19,FChampionships (WRIC) are being run
OL,20,Fconcurrently.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
