OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARower delighted after
OL,4,Achampionships' 'declare as British to
OL,5,Acompete' U-turn
OL,6,
OL,7,FCollins said he has now received an
OL,8,Fapology from British Rowing and will
OL,9,Fnow appear in both the British and
OL,10,FWorld rankings.
OL,12,FIn a statement, British Rowing said it
OL,13,Fhas since "clarified its FAQs and
OL,14,Fwebsite information" to make clear that
OL,15,FCollins is eligible for inclusion.
